OL,3,GNEWSABride's veil saved by rower after
OL,4,Ait blows away
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple, who now live in Flitwick,
OL,7,FBefordshire, said the incident did not
OL,8,Fdampen spirits but was very much a
OL,9,Fsource of chat and laughter at the
OL,10,Fwedding.
